WEBVTT

00:06:28.731 --> 00:06:30.063
(Laughter)

00:06:30.087 --> 00:06:31.510
One digit at a time,

00:06:31.534 --> 00:06:34.952
I shall try and determine
the digit you've left out.

00:06:34.976 --> 00:06:36.848
Starting with your seven-digit number,

00:06:36.872 --> 00:06:38.546
call out any six of them please.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:43.921
Volunteer: 1, 9, 7, 0, 4, 2.

00:06:43.945 --> 00:06:45.635
AB: Did you leave out the number 6?

00:06:45.659 --> 00:06:46.976
Good, OK, that's one.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.976
You have a seven-digit number,
call out any six of them please.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.071
Volunteer: 4, 4, 8, 7, 5.

00:06:53.373 --> 00:06:57.764
I think I only heard five numbers.
I -- wait -- 44875 --

00:06:57.788 --> 00:06:59.297
did you leave out the number 6?

00:06:59.321 --> 00:07:00.411
Same as she did, OK.